            HAI 1.3
              I HAS A targetName ITZ "dynamicValue"
              I HAS A dynamicValue
              I HAS A box ITZ A BUKKIT
              box HAS A slotValue
              GIMMEH SRS targetName
              GIMMEH box'Z slotValue
              VISIBLE dynamicValue
              VISIBLE box'Z slotValue
            KTHXBYE
            
